    // Explosion scar (2026-07-23): replaces the fallout particle spray. The
    // nuke_scar texture (Zero-K scar5_big) is stretched over r 94 (~120% of
    // the slag ring + voronoi fragment overhang) at full strength, alpha
    // shaping the falloff. Deliberately FIRST band, before destroy_all: the
    // r 32 core's debris shower and the shatter ring's rigid debris (r 64,
    // fragments overhang up to ~cell_size past it) carry scorched pixels,
    // and resolidified rubble stays scarred. The stain is a solid disc
    // through the ground, so crater walls exposed later are scarred too.
    // The shatter wave is fuse-5 so this scar is on screen a beat before
    // the ground bursts (extrapolation displays 4f ahead).
    {
      "stain": {
        "r": [
          0,
          94
        ],
        "strength": 1,
        "texture": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "destroy_all": {
        "r": [
          0,
          32
        ],
        "debris": true
      }
    },
    // Thermal pulse (2026-07-30). Reaches well past everything else the nuke
    // does — the r 65 melt wave, the r 64 shatter ring, the r 94 scar — so
    // the fringe of the blast is left hot rather than merely dirty. LAST
    // band on purpose: the r 32 core is already air by now, and air takes no
    // temperature, so this only heats what survived.
    //
    // 100 lights every fuel in one hit (core:wood 80, jungle timber 80 from
    // an ambient 0). The 190 limit is the "not-ground-melting" half: the
    // lowest melting point in the engine is core:sand at 200, so no amount
    // of nuking can turn ground to lava by heat alone. The r 65 melt wave
    // still makes its slag ring — that is a transmute, not a temperature,
    // and the two do not fight: slag spawns at 200, and a POSITIVE
    // modify_temperature never cools anything already above its limit, so
    // the 255 nuke_burst fireballs raining +25/limit-150 afterwards leave
    // the slag pool alone.
    {
      "modify_temperature": {
        "r": [
          0,
          100
        ],
        "amount": 100,
        "limit": 190
      }
    }
  ],
